# mc-agent does not read any secrets.
#
# The mod never stores API keys or tokens. It launches an ACP adapter process
# (e.g. @agentclientprotocol/claude-agent-acp) which reuses whatever
# authentication the host machine's agent CLI already has.
#
# This file exists only to document that fact and to satisfy the repo
# convention of shipping a .env.example instead of a .env.
#
# If you ever need to pass an environment variable to the adapter process,
# do it through the "agents.<name>.env" block in config/mcagent.json —
# not through a .env file in this repository.
